hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"978","Muhammad bin Abdullah bin Al-Mubarak Al-Makhzoumi and Yusuf bin Musa told us, they said: Abu Dawud told us, Al-Makhzoumi said: Al-Hafari, and he said Yusuf: Omar bin Saad, on the authority of Hafs bin Ghayath, on the authority of Humaid, on the authority of Abdullah bin Shaqiq, on the authority of Aisha, she said: “I saw the Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace May God bless him and grant him peace, he prays cross-legged.”"
